{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNks9BqERa2YsfQf3tUffs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale overall score\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965318/\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page, but the search results only show general reviewing advice from that page. The specific information about the rating scale and overall score format isn't displayed in these results. However, based on the first search result, I can see there is a dedicated Reviewer Guidelines page at corl2023.org.\n\nThe search results provided show that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly while pointing out obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors and reflecting them in scores. Additionally, reviewers are advised to be constructive and concrete, start with positive aspects and suggest improvements, and make reviews as informative and substantiated as possible.\n\nHowever, the specific details about the rating scale and overall score format don't appear to be included in these search results. You may want to visit the full Reviewer Guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines to find the complete rating scale information.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cecc2908-68ca-4714-bd9d-0379a2878afb","uuid":"c1846b05-b319-4832-95c1-3b8db0d5ce64","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:36:33.503Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale overall score","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01QvtCyLFsoSeuh6SjEW2Ber","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"ARR Reviewer Guidelines","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/"},{"title":"Best Reviewers Award for 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965318/"}]},"I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page, but the search results only show general reviewing advice from that page. The specific information about the rating scale and overall score format isn't displayed in these results. However, based on the first search result, I can see there is a dedicated Reviewer Guidelines page at corl2023.org.\n\nThe search results provided show that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly while pointing out obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors and reflecting them in scores. Additionally, reviewers are advised to be constructive and concrete, start with positive aspects and suggest improvements, and make reviews as informative and substantiated as possible.\n\nHowever, the specific details about the rating scale and overall score format don't appear to be included in these search results. You may want to visit the full Reviewer Guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines to find the complete rating scale information."],"durationSeconds":5.630305536}}
