{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0158KD9fhQLXDGtELC5Jmree","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 13:14 UTC | 更新原因: OFT confirmed bug, expanded D108 to 5-point sweep, updated GPU allocation plan\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA vision token compressibility 的架构依赖性分析 + Diagnose-then-Compress 框架。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🔬 Research + 📝 审稿进行中 + ✍️ Paper: **8 页 main body 达标**\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **论文**: 8 页 main body + 2 refs + 8 appendix = 18 总页。全文一致性检查 0 critical。π0 entropy 已统一为 0.959。4 张 figure 全部更新。\\\\n- **实验覆盖**: C1-C4 core claims 完成。C4-ext (OpenVLA VTR) 负结果已 reframe。D108 (L2 norm 统一) 扩展到 5 点 sweep。\\\\n- **OFT pruning**: ❌ 确认 eval 脚本 bug（k=1.0=0% SR）。全部 pruning 数据无效。Paper 只保留 entropy 对比。已停止所有 OFT eval。\\\\n- **D108 初步**: L2 norm k=0.7 Task 1 = 42%（vs random 49%），L2 ≈ random 支持架构决定论\\\\n- **X-VLA seed43**: k=0.9=97.6%（一致），k=0.7 进行中 ~68.3%（vs seed42=56.2%，variance ~12pp）\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中实验\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | 服务器:GPU | 预估完成 |\\\\n|------|-----------|---------|\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.7 | westd-27271:1 | ~15:50 UTC |\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.5 | westd-38929:0 | ~16:55 UTC |\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.3 | westd-38929:1 | ~16:55 UTC |\\\\n| VTC-only M=96 training | westd-41074:2 | ongoing |\\\\n| VTC-only M=64 training | westd-41074:3 | ongoing |\\\\n| VTC-only M=32 training | westd-27271:1 | ongoing (shared) |\\\\n| OpenVLA seed43 random sweep | westd-27271:0 | ongoing |\\\\n| X-VLA seed43 k=0.7 | cqa1:2 | ~14:30 UTC |\\\\n| X-VLA seed43 k=0.5 | cqa1:0 | ~16:00 UTC |\\\\n\\\\n## 待分配 GPU（高优先）\\\\n\\\\n| GPU | 计划任务 |\\\\n|-----|---------|\\\\n| westd-38929:2 | D108 L2 norm k=0.9 |\\\\n| westd-38929:3 | D108 L2 norm k=0.95 |\\\\n| westd-41074:0 | OpenVLA seed43 ra